WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:19.003
Whoa! Who are you?

2
00:00:19.004 --> 00:00:23.459
I am an African elephant.

3
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:29.190
We're the biggest land mammals on earth.

4
00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:33.297
You live in Africa, right?

5
00:00:33.298 --> 00:00:39.600
Yes! We live in grasslands and rain forests.

6
00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:44.896
Some African elephants live in deserts.

7
00:00:44.897 --> 00:00:48.172
How do you stay cool?

8
00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:52.454
We spray our backs with water.

9
00:00:52.455 --> 00:00:57.029
Then we throw dust on the water.

10
00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:07.078
We use our trunks for that.

11
00:01:07.079 --> 00:01:11.141
Your trunk is amazing!

12
00:01:11.142 --> 00:01:17.911
Yes! We breathe and drink with our trunks.

13
00:01:17.912 --> 00:01:22.900
We can grab food with them too.

14
00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:25.870
What do you eat?

15
00:01:25.871 --> 00:01:32.588
We like leaves, bark, roots, fruit, and grass.

16
00:01:32.589 --> 00:01:37.269
We're big. So we eat a lot!

17
00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:41.224
Wow! Look at your tusks!

18
00:01:41.225 --> 00:01:45.290
Our tusks are long teeth.

19
00:01:45.291 --> 00:01:51.595
We use them to dig for roots.

20
00:01:51.596 --> 00:01:55.066
Do you have any enemies?

21
00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:59.254
Most animals leave us alone.

22
00:01:59.255 --> 00:02:06.145
But some people hunt us for our tusks.

23
00:02:06.146 --> 00:02:08.762
I'm hungry again.

24
00:02:08.763 --> 00:02:11.779
See you later.

25
00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:19.793
Good-bye, African Elephant!
